This product is a Swift port of the DESIGN.md format tooling.

It is derived from the DESIGN.md project by Google Labs:
  https://github.com/google-labs-code/design.md
  Copyright 2026 Google LLC, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The DESIGN.md format specification, section model, `{path.to.token}` reference
syntax, lint-rule semantics, color science, and DTCG export shape originate
from that project and are reimplemented here in Swift. The bundled format
specification document (Sources/DesignMD/Resources/spec.md) is adapted from the
upstream `docs/spec.md`.

This port adds Apple-platform behavior that is NOT part of upstream:
  - `pt` (points) accepted as a first-class dimension unit
  - SwiftUI `Theme.swift` and Asset Catalog (`.xcassets`) exporters

